=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward off -----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 24.04,$
# whose logger is rsyslog. No file forwards, and hardn.yml names$
# 192.0.2.50, port 514, TCP: Set servers, its description the$
# server.$
$
# Syslog Settings ##############################################$
$
  [ ] Syslog               Review ~ not forwarding$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               rsyslog$
   -  Server               None$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.50:514 TCP$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          192.0.2.50:514 TCP$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

